
These files are for download or visualisation/animation of the latest radar data.
Data is available for the last 14 days only!
 
It is not automated. 
The reanalysis CPC files are only available 8 days later an only as the values at full hours. The respective script takes this into account. 
In rare cases, if the reanalysis file has other quality flag in the filname, you will have more than 24h files per day. 
There please always use the newer file with the higher quality flag in the filename.
